6-05-28T07:00:00+00:00", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5"}], "model": {"prior_margin": -11.22, "prior_sd": 5.11, "poll_margin": null, "poll_sd": null, "poll_weight": 0.0, "fundamentals": {"margin": -5.21, "lean": -11.0, "environment": 8.2, "incumbency": -2.0, "money": -0.41}, "rating_margin": -15.22, "sigma_race": 6.5, "sigma_total": 7.27, "baseline_margin": -11.22, "analyst_adjustment": -1.78, "key_factors": ["District's R+11 partisan lean in a Republican-held Tennessee seat", "Unanimous expert consensus rating the race Safe or Solid R", "Van Epps's large fundraising and outside-spending advantage", "No public general-election polling to test the race"], "rationale": "The R+11 district, incumbent advantage, and a 9-for-9 expert consensus of Safe/Solid R leave little room for doubt, and Polymarket prices Van Epps at 95%. Copeland's respectable fundraising is not enough to overcome the structural lean, so the forecast sits slightly beyond the fundamentals-based margin.", "watch": "A late wave of Democratic outside spending or polling showing Copeland within single digits would warrant moving this toward Likely R.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["No usable general-election polls; forecast rests on fundamentals and expert ratings.", "Incumbent Matt Van Epps (R) is running."]}, "overview": "Incumbent Republican Matt Van Epps seeks a full term in Tennessee's 7th District against Democrat Darden Copeland, a Nashville businessman who won a primary rematch in August. The redrawn district leans Republican by about eleven points, and every major race rater calls it Safe or Solid R, with only The Economist at Likely R. Polymarket gives Van Epps roughly a 95 percent chance of winning.\n\nVan Epps has raised about $2.3 million and benefits from roughly $2.5 million in outside support, though outside groups are also spending against him. Copeland has raised about $870,000, a credible but far smaller total. With no public general-election polls, the race rests on fundamentals, which point to a comfortable Republican win.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0399, "margin": -11.34}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0635, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0506, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0512, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0318, "margin": -13.0}]}